---
// Tile 01 — Introduction + Skills & Stack
---

<section class="tile" id="tile-01" data-section="01" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="tile-inner t01">
    <div class="t01-grid">
      <!-- Left column: role, prose, highlights -->
      <div class="t01-left">
        <h1 class="t01-role">
          Full-Stack Software Engineer<br />&amp; People Manager
        </h1>
        <!--
        <p class="t01-location">
          Philippines → Poland &amp; Europe<br />Remote-friendly · Hybrid
        </p>
        -->
        <div class="t01-prose">
          <p>
            I am a full-stack software engineer with 11+ years of experience
            delivering production software across enterprise, fintech, and SaaS
            domains, primarily in .NET and React. Most of my career has been
            spent as a core contributor to a large-scale enterprise Benefits
            Administration platform, working across backend systems, REST APIs,
            React frontends, SQL Server, and ETL pipelines for 100+ global
            organisations.
          </p>
          <p>Looking for a mid-level engineering role in Poland or Europe.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="t01-data-col">
          <div class="t01-data-row">
            <span class="t01-data-num">What I bring</span>
            <span class="t01-data-label"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="t01-data-row">
            <span class="t01-data-label"
              >End-to-end system ownership (architecture, APIs, frontend, cloud
              deployment)</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="t01-data-row">
            <span class="t01-data-label"
              >Strong backend architecture and API design, and thorough testing</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="t01-data-row">
            <span class="t01-data-label"
              >Modern frontend development (React, Next.js)</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="t01-data-row">
            <span class="t01-data-label"
              >People leadership (mentoring engineers, code reviews,
              cross-timezone delivery)</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="learning-callout">
          <div class="learning-lbl">Industries</div>
          <div class="learning-tags">
            <span>Financial Services</span>
            <span>Banking</span>
            <span>Insurance &amp; Benefits</span>
            <span>Enterprise SaaS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="learning-callout">
          <div class="learning-lbl">Languages</div>
          <div class="learning-tags">
            <span>English (Fluent)</span>
            <span>Filipino / Tagalog (Native)</span>
            <span>Spanish (A2)</span>
            <span>Polish (A1 — learning)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column: skills & stack -->
      <div class="t01-skills">
        <div class="t01-skills-header">
          <div class="tile-label">Skills &amp; Stack</div>
          <div class="skill-legend">
            <span class="legend-title">Legend</span>
            <span class="bp">Core</span>
            <span class="bs">Proficient</span>
            <span class="bl">Soft Skills</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t01-skill-groups">
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Backend &amp; API</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">C#</span>
              <span class="bp">.NET</span>
              <span class="bp">.NET Framework</span>
              <span class="bp">ASP.NET Core</span>
              <span class="bp">Web API</span>
              <span class="bp">RESTful APIs</span>
              <span class="bp">Entity Framework</span>
              <span class="bp">LINQ</span>
              <span class="bs">NUnit / xUnit</span>
              <span class="bs">Selenium</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Frontend</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">React</span>
              <span class="bp">ASP.NET MVC</span>
              <span class="bp">ASP.NET WebForms</span>
              <span class="bp">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="bp">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="bp">HTML</span>
              <span class="bp">CSS</span>
              <span class="bs">Next.js</span>
              <span class="bs">Astro</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Data &amp; Cloud</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">Azure</span>
              <span class="bp">SQL Server</span>
              <span class="bp">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="bs">SSIS / SSRS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">DevOps &amp; Tooling</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">Git / GitHub</span>
              <span class="bp">Azure DevOps</span>
              <span class="bp">CI/CD</span>
              <span class="bs">Docker</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Practices</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">Clean Architecture</span>
              <span class="bp">Domain-Driven Design</span>
              <span class="bp">N-Tier Architecture</span>
              <span class="bp">Design Patterns</span>
              <span class="bp">Code Reviews</span>
              <span class="bp">Unit &amp; Integration Testing</span>
              <span class="bp">Technical Documentation</span>
              <span class="bp">Agile / Scrum</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Security</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bp">OAuth2 / OIDC</span>
              <span class="bp">JWT</span>
              <span class="bs">Microsoft Entra ID</span>
              <span class="bs">OWASP</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <div class="sg-label">Leadership</div>
            <div class="badge-row">
              <span class="bl">People Management</span>
              <span class="bl">Mentoring</span>
              <span class="bl">Remote Team Coordination</span>
              <span class="bl">Stakeholder Communication</span>
              <span class="bl">Cross-functional Collaboration</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="learning-callout">
          <div class="learning-lbl">Actively Exploring</div>
          <div class="learning-tags">
            <span>Azure OpenAI Service</span>
            <span>Semantic Kernel</span>
            <span>AZ-204</span>
            <span>Azure Container Apps</span>
            <span>Blazor</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
